&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:16pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:CreditorsNotesRegardingOverdraftContractsAndOrLoanCommitmentsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:16pt;"&gt;※７  有形固定資産の減価償却累計額は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:27pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
